id: psychic-grip
name: Psychic Grip
advancement: true
prerequisite: Telekinesis, Force or Magic Score 8+
tpCost: 5
# The Telekinesis Unique Ability is not in this system yet: said, for the table.
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Whoever your Binding holds has 2(T) off their Dice Score against your Telekinesis.
text: >
  Psychic Grip: You are able to move the target you’ve trapped with the power of your mind.
  –Prerequisites: Telekinesis, Force or Magic Score 8+
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: While an Opponent is Pinned due to the effects of Binding, reduce their Dice Score for the Clash against the
  effects of Telekinesis by 2(T).
